Text Notes 9500 6000 0    60    ~ 0
VCC BUCK: starts at 8 V. Firmware must set 10 V through the internal power-management interface after every VM return.
Text Notes 9500 6450 0    60    ~ 0
Pin 64 REGIN and pin 1 REG3V3/VDD are both tied to external 3V3. The internal 3V3 regulator stays disabled.
Text Notes 9500 6900 0    60    ~ 0
SCREF = approx. 0.30 V (100k/10k). This is a safe first-build threshold network; confirm trip current with shunt/gain tolerances before power testing.
Text Notes 9500 7350 0    60    ~ 0
PB8/BOOT0 has a 10k pulldown. FEEDBACK_ENABLE_N is pulled high, so the mux cannot drive PB8 while reset is active.
$EndSCHEMATC
